Subject: Bayesian analysis for fractions of mortality
Message-ID: <r9uXKXaeWzk.EwajxTsU4ZsJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/hmecology/c/r9uXKXaeWzk/m/EwajxTsU4ZsJ>
